{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"X\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S07-S09：一度把留不住亲密的痛楚具体化为对方将来不再需要自己，略微偏向被需要、被陪伴的焦虑，而不完全是对亲密幸福终将消逝的感伤。\",\n    \"S13：仍有想听对方保证的倾向，但同时追问即使听到保证，未来是否真能一直这么好，因此没有把问题完全收窄为寻求承诺。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S03：增加了想确认对方是否也有同样感受的念头，使关注稍微转向感情是否对等。\",\n    \"S04：把不敢表达的顾虑更多落在怕给对方造成负担、让对方为难上，偏向表达方式带来的关系风险。\",\n    \"S13：突出想要一句不变的准话、明知无人能承诺永远，以及通过收回喜欢来减少未来的疼痛，使主线更容易偏向对确定性和保证的渴求，以及自我保护。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条线都完整呈现了亲密带来的幸福、对失去的预感，以及两者相互牵动的变化。X更侧重于明知无法留住仍真切享受和付出亲密的矛盾；Y则在S03、S13更明显地把焦点推向感情是否对等、能否得到永不改变的保证，因而稍微偏离了Center本身。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d212ecea-bc2f-40e8-b98d-c5f20fd2fd50", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T093340333191Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.157, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T09:34:01.494793+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "be7772084b3ec97420887e4165ea3d3d444f3e54cac98942e1f852bce33f859d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sess